## Multi-Instance Safety

When running multiple strategies simultaneously, each instance auto-isolates:

| Strategy | client_id | Telemetry DB | Cache File |
|----------|-----------|-------------|------------|
| Manatee | 10 | `live_telemetry_cid10.db` | `warm_start_cache_cid10.parquet` |
| Koala | 11 | `live_telemetry_cid11.db` | `warm_start_cache_cid11.parquet` |
| Manatee Single | 12 | `live_telemetry_cid12.db` | `warm_start_cache_cid12.parquet` |
| Ensemble | 13 | `live_telemetry_cid13.db` | `warm_start_cache_cid13.parquet` |

**Duplicate prevention:**
- `market_bars`: UNIQUE on `timestamp` -- duplicate bars from concurrent instances are silently dropped
- `raw_front_month_bars`: UNIQUE on `(timestamp, contract_month)` -- same protection
- `shadow_log`: UNIQUE on `timestamp` -- built-in from day one

**IBKR API lines:** Each instance creates 2 data subscriptions (continuous + front-month). 4 strategies = 8 lines out of ~100 limit. Safe for current scale.

